        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-24T04:59:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just wanted to keep as much as possible in one place: soong.\n\nBut yes, we can omit LOCAL_VNDK_PRIVATE in favor of VNDK_PRIVATE_LIBRARIES. Modified androidmk.go accordingly.\n\nI can remove VNDK_PRIVATE_LIBRARIES in favor of LOCAL_VNDK_PRIVATE, but then I need to build the list in make again to use the list when dynamically generating ld.config.txt. This isn\u0027t neat.",
      "parentUuid": "f0328e96_149a72df",
      "revId": "80b3253d739c18bb5a665f48a1f6250636ed31dd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
