        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-24T04:59:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "then we need to mark static libs depended by private vndk libs as\n\nvendor_available: false,\nvndk:{enabled: false},\n\nwhich looks weird for static lib.\n\nAnyway, I did that.",
